flowchart TD
    PR[Pull Request Created / Synchronized] --> Pipeline[PR Orchestrator Pipeline\n.github/workflows/pr-pipeline.yml]
    Pipeline --> Autofix[0. Autofix\neslint --fix + prettier --write\non changed files]
    Autofix -->|fixes pushed| Pipeline

    subgraph Gates ["All Gates in Parallel ~1-2m (each records a gate status + passed label)"]
        Autofix -->|nothing to fix| Gate[1. Metadata\nPR Gatekeeper]
        Autofix --> Lint[2. Lint\nESLint / Prettier / Super-Linter]
        Autofix --> Build[3. Build\nNode/TS, Go, Rust, Java, .NET]
        Autofix --> Tests[4. Tests & Coverage\nDiff-scoped >= 80%]
        Autofix --> Security[5. Security\nCodeQL SAST, Dep Review, Secrets]
        Autofix --> DocEval[6. Docs Drift\npr-docs.yml + gh-aw evaluator]
    end

    subgraph Remediation ["Parallel Remediation: one agent per failed gate"]
        Gate -->|needs-metadata| FixMeta[🤖 PR Validation Agent\nDirect API Update]
        Lint -->|lint-failed| FixLint[🤖 PR Lint Fixer]
        Tests -->|test-required| AgentTest[🤖 PR Test Generator]
        Security -->|alerts| AgentSec[🤖 PR Security Fixers]
        DocEval -->|docs-required| AgentDoc[🤖 PR Doc Updater]
        Build -->|build-failed| BlockBuild[❌ No agent: manual fix]
        FixLint & AgentTest & AgentSec & AgentDoc --> StackedPRs[Stacked PRs targeting feature branch]
        StackedPRs & FixMeta --> Relay[7. Remediation Relay\npr-stacked-merge.yml\nSquash-merge & audit comment]
        Relay -->|re-check only the repaired gate,\ncarry the other results over| Recheck[Standalone gate run\ne.g. pr-lint.yml]
    end

    Gates --> Verdict{pr-quality verdict}
    Recheck --> Verdict
    Verdict -->|gate still failing,\nnothing repairing| Fail([❌ pr-quality failure\nhuman takes over])
    Verdict -->|all green, some carried over| Pipeline
    Verdict -->|all green on this commit| Dispatcher

    subgraph Code_Review [Review & Final Sign-Off]
        Dispatcher[8. PR Review Dispatcher\nPost consolidated summary] --> CopilotReview[GitHub Copilot Code Review\nAI semantic & architecture review\n1-click commit suggestions]
        CopilotReview --> HumanReview[Human Peer Review & Sign-Off\nSingle review session for all changes]
    end

    HumanReview --> Merge([🚀 Merge into Main])
